      "blockIndex": 1,
      "sourceBlockId": "block_21",
      "sourceUnitId": null,
      "sourceText": "Adventurers and Command Combatants may use the COUNTER Ability for 2 SP. However, if they successfully Dodged the Attack being Countered, they may reduce the cost of the Counter by 1 SP. Some Items and Disciplines also have the COUNTER Tag listed as an Ability. In cases where there is an SP cost on a COUNTER Tag this SP cost may also be reduced by 1. Intelligent Combatants will only COUNTER if their Combatant Card instructs them to.",
      "spanKey": "page_49_block_1__pt-BR",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "proposalText": "Aventureiros e Combatentes de Comando podem usar CONTRA-ATACAR por 2 SP. Se esquivarem com sucesso do Ataque, podem reduzir o custo do Contra-ataque em 1 SP. Alguns Itens e Disciplinas também listam a Tag CONTRA-ATACAR como Habilidade. Se houver custo de SP nessa Tag, ele também pode ser reduzido em 1. Combatentes Inteligentes só usam CONTRA-ATACAR se a Carta de Combatente instruir.",
